# The Unswell commit this playground is built from. Every deploy is built from
# exactly this commit, so the version the page prints names a real revision.
#
# Bump with: scripts/pin-unswell.sh [ref]     (default: origin/main)
#
# version and date are what git reports for commit. scripts/build-wasm.sh
# checks all three against git before it builds, so a hand-edited line fails
# the build rather than mislabeling a binary.
